00:13:21.000 --> 00:13:25.440
Glyn Povah: Happens into relying parties, and in this case, into their call centres.

124
00:13:25.670 --> 00:13:31.430
Glyn Povah: By scammers and fraudsters, and they're impersonating, you know, customers like you and me.

125
00:13:31.690 --> 00:13:39.010
Glyn Povah: With enough stolen data, or phished data, that they can pass the fairly basic security checks,

126
00:13:39.440 --> 00:13:51.399
