127
00:13:51.740 --> 00:13:56.350
Glyn Povah: Sometimes with additional methods like SMS OTPs, but again, we know that

128
00:13:56.740 --> 00:14:05.859
Glyn Povah: the SMS OTPs and SIM swaps are quite challenged these days if you've got, scammers, particularly in targeted attacks, that really want to take over accounts.

129
00:14:06.350 --> 00:14:11.949
Glyn Povah: So… so based upon the market insight that impersonation was fraud was happening

130
00:14:12.440 --> 00:14:17.790
Glyn Povah: Intercall centres of big brands, and money was being lost, sometimes millions of pounds.

131
00:14:18.280 --> 00:14:27.120
