00:14:51.680 --> 00:14:54.769
Glyn Povah: But really, you know, what is Trusted Caller Identity all about?

135
00:14:55.130 --> 00:15:02.389
Glyn Povah: It's really about leveraging the operator assets, so the SIM cards, and some of the APIs we're building, about understanding real-time

