00:33:24.790 --> 00:33:31.329
Eric Drury (Forth Consulting): to the caller. Because, you know, one of the problems that we… one of the challenges we see is…

237
00:33:31.590 --> 00:33:41.799
Eric Drury (Forth Consulting): trying to remove friction, but when you remove all the friction, then you've got a… you've got a customer who's like, well, where's the security? I don't feel secure, it feels too smooth.

