00:37:01.450 --> 00:37:16.140
Eric Drury (Forth Consulting): And, yeah, so I'm just personally just wondering, is this going to be the, sort of, the new normal, where we're flipping back and forth between apps, or whether they're sort of streamlined into, you know, the app that you're actually using, so…

