00:38:16.260 --> 00:38:18.640
Glyn Povah: The management and control of their own data now.

268
00:38:18.770 --> 00:38:25.189
Glyn Povah: you know, we can argue whether that's a good thing, and whether people are interested at all in that or not, and I think a lot of them are not.

