00:38:25.520 --> 00:38:30.459
Glyn Povah: And that's the friction that they don't want. But on the other hand.

270
00:38:31.000 --> 00:38:37.950
Glyn Povah: You know, it is… it is allowing them to choose how their data is used, and putting them very much in control of it, so it is changing the model there.

